<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT WEST INDIES BY 62 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT WEST INDIES BY 62 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat West Indies by 62 runs in the second match of the best-of-three World Series limited overs final at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 165 all out in 48.3 overs; West Indies 103 all out in 40.3 overs.</p>
